  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: $3 a \\alpha^2+3 b \\alpha+c=0$\n$$\nx=3 \\alpha \\Rightarrow \\alpha=\\frac{x}{3}\n$$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& 3 a \\frac{x^2}{9}+3 b \\cdot \\frac{x}{3}+c=0 \\\\\n& a x^2+3 b x+3 c=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
